{"id": "unknown-2026-08-11-007", "date": "2026-08-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 33, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Scientists demonstrate outdoor operability of reflector-assisted spherical photovoltaic modules", "content": "<p>Researchers in Qatar developed a 450-cell, 0.70 m-diameter spherical PV prototype with a hemispherical aluminium reflector that substantially improves energy capture. The system, however, demonstrates mainly directional/seasonal benefits rather than superior annual yield or economic competitiveness compared to a flat counterpart.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/11/scientists-demonstrate-outdoor-operability-of-reflector-assisted-spherical-photovoltaic-modules/\">Sci", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/11/scientists-demonstrate-outdoor-operability-of-reflector-assisted-spherical-photovoltaic-modules/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-11-008", "date": "2026-08-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 33, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Rhoss launches propane heat pumps for multi-family residential applications", "content": "<p>The Italian manufacturer has expanded its MidiPACK-PI R290 heat pump range with four new models offering heating capacities of 38.2 kW to 64.7 kW and cooling capacities of 34.6 kW to 60.3 kW. The units have a reported SCOP of 3.34 to 3.50 and can produce water at temperatures of up to 80 C.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/11/rhoss-launches-propane-heat-pumps-for-multi-family-residential-applications/\">Rhoss launches propane heat pumps for multi-family residential ", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/11/rhoss-launches-propane-heat-pumps-for-multi-family-residential-applications/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-11-009", "date": "2026-08-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 33, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["surpass"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "U.S. could surpass 100 GW of annual inverter manufacturing capacity by 2027", "content": "<p>The FCC’s addition of foreign-made inverters to its “Covered List” is set to accelerate U.S. domestic manufacturing. Wood Mackenzie expects annual PV inverter and PCS capacity to exceed 100 GWac by 2027.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/11/u-s-could-surpass-100-gw-of-annual-inverter-manufacturing-capacity-by-2027/\">U.S. could surpass 100 GW of annual inverter manufacturing capacity by 2027</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Glob", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/11/u-s-could-surpass-100-gw-of-annual-inverter-manufacturing-capacity-by-2027/", "type": "rss"}]}
